<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TJX started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TJX started as hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said it initiated coverage of TJX Cos Inc with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 45-3/8 in late morning NYSE trade.</p>
